  "body": "- **打开大型 APK 更快、更省内存**：优化加载和首次查询过程，减少查找类、字符串引用及调用关系时的等待与峰值内存占用。\r\n- **查看 Smali 更快**：加速首次和后续方法反汇编，缩短逐个查看方法、追踪调用链时的等待。\r\n- **反复查询 APK 资源更快**：同一数据集内复用已解析的资源表，按 ID、名称或类型继续查找时，无需每次重新解析。\r\n- **新增 MCP 精简输出模式**：查询、Smali 和 APK 资源工具支持 `compact: true`，减少重复内容，让同样的响应大小限制容纳更多结果。需客户端支持结构化结果；默认输出保持兼容。\r\n- **改善 MCP 客户端兼容性**：修复新版协议下工具和资源列表缺少缓存字段的问题。服务版本信息增加构建提交，便于确认版本和排查问题。\r\n- **命令行查询更高效**：加快大量表格结果的输出，并优化忽略大小写的文本查找。\r\n- **改善特殊 APK 的兼容性**：文件名解析与 Android 的行为保持一致，修复部分 APK 被错误拒绝或 DEX、资源文件定位异常的问题。\r\n- **优化网页端体验**：改善打开 APK、首次浏览包和类，以及再次访问页面时的加载速度。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- **Faster APK loading with lower memory usage:** Reduced loading and first-query overhead when looking up classes, string references, and call relationships.\r\n- **Faster Smali viewing:** Improved both initial and subsequent method disassembly, reducing waits when inspecting methods and following call chains.\r\n- **Faster repeated resource queries:** Parsed resource tables are reused within a dataset, so subsequent lookups by ID, name, or type no longer require reparsing the table.\r\n- **New compact MCP output:** Query, Smali, and APK resource tools now accept `compact: true` to reduce duplicated content and fit more results within the same response size limit. Requires a client that reads structured results; default output remains compatible.\r\n- **Improved MCP client compatibility:** Fixed missing cache metadata in tool and resource lists under the newer protocol. Server version information now includes the build commit to help identify builds and troubleshoot issues.\r\n- **More efficient CLI queries:** Faster output for large text tables and optimized case-insensitive text searches.\r\n- **Better compatibility with unusual APKs:** Filename handling now matches Android, fixing cases where APKs were incorrectly rejected or DEX and resource entries were resolved under incorrect names.\r\n- **Improved web experience:** Faster APK opening, initial package and class browsing, and loading on return visits.",
